| `c_emit_secret.oo:135` | check: `check_secret_println_sinks` starts with same parse |
| `c_secret_refuse_println_ident` L84–88 | refuse iff `__sec__name=="1"` |
| `c_secret_refuse_sink_ident` L92–97 | same key for other sinks |

